<div class="text guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Frost Mage DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c8">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Frost Mage DPS in Phase 4</span></h2>The gearing path for a frost mage should be to get hit capped, crit capped while buffed with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83074/fingers-of-frost">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_wintersgrasp.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Frost</span></a>, and then everything else into haste rating.<br/>This means we'll use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71881/brilliant-queens-garnet">
<img alt="Brilliant Queen's Garnet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Queen's Garnet</span></a> for red sockets, and if needed either the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71842/potent-lava-coral">
<img alt="Potent Lava Coral" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potent Lava Coral</span></a> or the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71864/veiled-shadow-spinel">
<img alt="Veiled Shadow Spinel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Shadow Spinel</span></a> if you have a good socket bonus and need a yellow or blue gem respectively.<br/>
<br/>The critical strike cap is 33% since <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83074/fingers-of-frost">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_wintersgrasp.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Frost</span></a> triples the critical strike chance whenever active - this means you want at most 20,3% critical strike chance from gear (19.3% as a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_worgen_male.gif");'>Worgen</span>)<br/>
<br/>Mastery perform badly for frost mage, so don't bother with it unless the alternative options just don't exist. If you have to take an item with said stat, reforge it into a relevant previously mentioned stat as shown below.<br/>
<br/>
