<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Frost Mage Phase 4</h3>Unlike past phases, we'll no longer be able to buy the normal mode tier tokens through the valor vendor, this means we instead focus on just upgrading the baseline items we have.<br/>To be more specific, the cloak and neck, listed 1 and 2, are both best in slot items this phase, so try and prioritize these.<br/>
<br/>Other than those two, the rest are upgrades as well, though not as relevant - and the last 3 items (gloves, head, chest,) are not very important because realistically you'll be using tier items in those slots.<div class="pad"></div>
