<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head">Head for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The tier 13 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78796/time-lords-hood">
<img alt="Time Lord's Hood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Time Lord's Hood</span></a> is the easiest choice here since it helps provides the tier set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>In the case that the tailoring legs are out of your budget, which is understandable, then the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71421/flickering-cowl">
<img alt="Flickering Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flickering Cowl</span></a> is a very solid alternative since it helps provide hit and removes the need for all the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71864/veiled-shadow-spinel">
<img alt="Veiled Shadow Spinel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Shadow Spinel</span></a> in the "perfect" set listed at the top of the guide.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
