<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>Same as with the head slot, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78843/time-lords-mantle">
<img alt="Time Lord's Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Time Lord's Mantle</span></a> is the pre-raid best in slot due to the tier set bonuses and item level of the tier items themselves.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
