<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist">Wrist for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The tailoring <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71989/bracers-of-unconquered-power">
<img alt="Bracers of Unconquered Power" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Unconquered Power</span></a> are pre-raid best in slot and are only replaced by the phase best bracers.<br/>There's also the Valor <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77324/chronoboost-bracers">
<img alt="Chronoboost Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chronoboost Bracers</span></a> bracers which are slightly worse but might be a lot cheaper or you can even farm them on one of your alt characters and then send them to your mage.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, if either of the previously mentioned bracers are out of your budget, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78425/bracers-of-the-banished">
<img alt="Bracers of the Banished" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Banished</span></a> are a lot easier to obtain and are still pretty good, these are better than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71265/emberflame-bracers">
<img alt="Emberflame Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emberflame Bracers</span></a> but worse than the tailoring wrists.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68786/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
