<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands">Hands for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78766/time-lords-gloves">
<img alt="Time Lord's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Time Lord's Gloves</span></a> are the recommended gloves to help obtain the set bonuses, but in the case you don't wanna gamble on the random suffix ilvl 391 headpiece, nor have the budget for the tailoring legs, then the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78466/gloves-of-liquid-smoke">
<img alt="Gloves of Liquid Smoke" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Liquid Smoke</span></a> are a very good off-piece to use with tier 13 on the other four slots.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: Now in cataclysm you can use both a tinker and an enchanter, so use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> combined with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52749/enchant-gloves-haste">
<img alt="Enchant Gloves - Haste" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Haste</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif");'>Engineering</span> is highly recommended as a <span class="c8">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_mage.gif");'>Mage</span></span> profession.</div></div>
