<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist">Waist for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The LFR version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78398/cord-of-the-slain-champion">
<img alt="Cord of the Slain Champion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Slain Champion</span></a> now available from the new twilight heroic protocol dungeons are the new pre-raid best in slot.<br/>
<br/>The Valor <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77179/tentacular-belt">
<img alt="Tentacular Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tentacular Belt</span></a> also exists, but because of the valor cap, it's unrealistic to get as pre-raid unless you're already very deep into phase phase and the cap has increased a lot - in that case it's a solid upgrade.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: The following enchants can be used simultaneously:<ul class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
