<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs">Legs for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>Ideally you'll use this slot for the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71980/lavaquake-legwraps">
<img alt="Lavaquake Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lavaquake Legwraps</span></a> off-piece with four pieces of tier 13 on the remaining slots where it's available.<br/>
<br/>If that off-piece is out of your budget, you can use either the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71421/flickering-cowl">
<img alt="Flickering Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flickering Cowl</span></a> headpiece if you want to gamble for the wildfire or flashfire suffixes, or the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78466/gloves-of-liquid-smoke">
<img alt="Gloves of Liquid Smoke" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Liquid Smoke</span></a> gloves and then use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78815/time-lords-leggings">
<img alt="Time Lord's Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Time Lord's Leggings</span></a> in the leg slot instead.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
