<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet">Feet for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78457/janglespur-jackboots">
<img alt="Janglespur Jackboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Janglespur Jackboots</span></a> are the main option for this slot.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77176/kavans-forsaken-treads">
<img alt="Kavan's Forsaken Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kavan's Forsaken Treads</span></a> are technically available before raid, but unless you're buying them from another player or using an alt character for farm them and then trade them to your mage, I don't recommend prioritizing it since it'll delay other bigger upgrades you can get from the valor vendor such as the best in slot neck and cloak.<br/>If you are further into phase 4 and the valor cap has increased a lot, then this is actually a pretty good option that's better than what's listed here.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
