<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71213/amulet-of-burning-brilliance">
<img alt="Amulet of Burning Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Burning Brilliance</span></a> is the only item worth mentioning here, it's also very easy to get.<br/>
<br/>If you're in week 2 or further, then you can buy the valor cloak and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77088/opal-of-the-secret-order">
