<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings">Rings for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The LFR versions of the two best in slot trinkets are the best in slot trinkets, now available from the new heroic protocol twilight dungeons.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
