<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4 Pre-Raid</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78427/ring-of-the-riven">
<img alt="Ring of the Riven" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Riven</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78495/infinite-loop">
<img alt="Infinite Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Infinite Loop</span></a> from the new heroic protocol dungeon vendor are the new pre-raid best in slot.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71210/crystalline-brimstone-ring">
<img alt="Crystalline Brimstone Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_01b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystalline Brimstone Ring</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72888/ring-of-the-loyal-companion">
<img alt="Ring of the Loyal Companion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_106.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Loyal Companion</span></a> are both obtainable as soon as you hit level 85 since the currency for the former is obtainable before max level, and the latter is from a quest reward, this combo is the bare minimum to use while you farm the LFR options.<div class="pad"></div>
